1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,120
A Yin talisman array is carved on the main beam.

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,180
One bug can reproduce a hundred more.

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,640
With so many bookworms,

4
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:06,970
how do we get rid of them?

5
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:10,880
They've eaten the Lu family's literary aura for decades.

6
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:13,610
Tonight, let them eat something they shouldn't.

7
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:34,680
Xiaotang.

8
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:35,280
Add ink.

9
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,680
Don't let the talisman path break.

10
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:39,480
My ruler is an ancestral treasure of the Yanshi Yang technique lineage.

11
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:40,720
If we use it to write Yang talismans,

12
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:44,180
the bookworms will suffer a Yin-Yang clash when they eat them.

13
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,320
The bookworms have indeed disappeared.

14
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,380
The words are back.

15
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,000
Old man.

16
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,040
I knew it.

17
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:57,140
You've always been worried about this library.

18
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,080
Senior brother, be careful.

19
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:30,800
Xiaobao.

20
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:32,560
Go back to your room first.

21
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:34,690
Grandma will come play with you later.

22
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,920
This is the Lu family's library.

23
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,560
What was your grandfather's name?

24
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:46,600
Mo Asi.

25
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:50,180
He worked in the Lu family's backyard when he was young.

26
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,759
He carved a wooden bird on the beam,

27
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,200
and said when he made something of himself,

28
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,660
he would come back and marry a Lu family girl.

29
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,960
That girl waited for many years.

30
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:01,680
He never came back.

31
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,720
Go back and tell your family head

32
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:06,040
that the Lu family's books are still here,

33
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,840
and the old feelings are still here.

34
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,720
But if the Mo family steps in here again,

35
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:11,250
the affection will be gone.

36
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:28,360
What the old lady just said is true.

37
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:30,880
It's true.

38
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:31,780
How do you know?

39
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,480
It's always been here.

40
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,560
The Lu family and the Mo family have an old friendship.

41
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,720
The Lu family ancestors served in the Construction Department,

42
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,360
and had deep ties with the Mo family.

43
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,600
After the children had their accident,

44
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:03,120
I even invited a branch of the Mo family to take a look.

45
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,880
But they said there was nothing.

46
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:06,440
The bookworm curse has been broken.

47
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:08,970
The Lu family's vitality will slowly return.

48
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:11,300
This was left by the Lu family ancestors.

49
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:14,240
He said if the heir of the Yanshi Yang technique comes to get it,

50
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,370
I must give it to him.

51
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:17,160
Grandma, I'm so sleepy.

52
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,560
Okay, go to sleep if you're sleepy.

53
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,890
They pieced themselves together.

54
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:35,079
The key to open the Mo family's underground palace

55
00:03:35,079 --> 00:03:37,200
is still missing Li, Xun, and Gen.

56
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:48,440
Rest your eyes.

57
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,840
Thank you.

58
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:03,930
You're still up so late.

59
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:06,560
I was thinking about my teacher.

60
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,920
He studied this kind of head-to-tail interlocking mortise and tenon,

61
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:10,360
saying it represents a cycle.

62
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:13,020
Unfortunately, his treatise wasn't finished.

63
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:14,580
When we rescue Master,

64
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:16,640
I'll help you finish organizing the materials.

65
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,920
Your teacher's research,

66
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,519
someone should continue it.

67
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:21,980
After my teacher's accident,

68
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:26,360
many people said my investigation into the Mo family was just wild thoughts.

69
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,760
Only you believed me.

70
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:36,520
Thank you.

71
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:46,140
Childhood sweethearts really can't beat someone who drops from the sky.

72
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:52,560
This is what the Mo family ancestors left in the Lu family.

73
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:54,640
See if it's useful.

74
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,480
Grandma Lu.

75
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:04,400
About what year is this map from?

76
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:10,360
The early years of the previous dynasty.

77
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,360
This circle isn't an ordinary mark.

78
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:16,690
The person who drew the circle used the Luban technique.

79
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,880
The ancestors of the Lu and Mo families

80
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:21,920
did indeed go to Longhu Mountain.

81
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:25,240
There is a small Taoist temple at the back of Longhu Mountain.

82
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:28,240
Xuanchen fought the Mo family there thirty years ago,

83
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:31,840
and said there was a mechanism hidden behind the Sanqing statue.

84
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:35,159
Then our next stop is Longhu Mountain.

85
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,480
This is the place.

86
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:48,620
It has been abandoned for many years.

87
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:02,940
No new footprints.

88
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,720
The Mo family didn't come.

89
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,800
Mo Wenshan probably doesn't know there's something hidden here.

90
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,200
He couldn't beat Xuanchen back then,

91
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:09,130
so he retreated.

92
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:17,160
The ring symbols from the end of the old dynasty turn inward.

93
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:19,360
The previous dynasty often used the opposite direction.

94
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,760
My master taught me this.

95
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,040
Finally found it.

96
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:33,760
The Xun hexagram.

97
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,140
And my master's handwriting.

98
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,480
The Mo family didn't come.

99
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,800
I was nervous all the way for nothing.

100
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,800
It's better they didn't come.

101
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,240
Walking on mountain roads late at night,

102
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:49,120
even the post carriage isn't safe.

103
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,240
Let's stay for the night

104
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:52,640
and go down the mountain tomorrow morning.

105
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,720
There's movement outside.

106
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,600
Let's go check.

107
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:06,520
Mr. Chen.

108
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,000
By the order of the family head,

109
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,320
please hand over the copper coin and the notes.

110
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,360
What if I don't?

111
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,920
Then we'll have to use force.

112
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:42,060
The family head ordered us not to hurt you, Mr. Chen.

113
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,600
But mechanisms have no eyes.

114
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,080
Please be careful.

115
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,200
Xiaotang, guard the left side.

116
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:49,659
Uncle Zhou, Su Wan, set up the defense array.

117
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:53,760
Go.

118
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,620
A mechanical beast fused with Yang arts.

119
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:03,920
Let's see what you do now.
